Make a cunning feint that tricks your target into swapping places with you.  While moving, you take the opportunity to trip them, pinning and dazing them for 2 turns.

Switching places distracts your foes and allows you to improve your defenses:  For [1, 2, 3, 3, 4 (TL1-5)] turns, Dual Weapon Mastery yields one extra parry each turn and you are [15%, 27%, 35%, 41%, 45% (TL1-5)] less likely to miss your parry opportunities.

The chance to pin and to daze increases with your Accuracy
